== Effects ==
* Spawns a red attack fly [[Familiar#Orbital Familiars|that circles around Isaac]], and deals 5 damage per tick or 75 damage per second on contact.
** The fly circles farther out than regular orbitals, but closer than {{i|Forever alone}}.
* {{transformation contribution|Beelzebub}}

== Notes ==
* While most orbital familiars orbit Isaac counter-clockwise, Distant Admiration orbits clockwise. It shares this orbit ring, speed, and pattern with {{i|Bot Fly}}.

